ize:13.0pt;\"><b>예비 및 초기창업자</b> 여러분의 많은 관심과 참여를 부탁드립니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><br></span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">1.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 14pt;\">모집규모</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 13pt;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">:</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;20</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">팀 내외&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">개인 또는 팀</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">)</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">2.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 14pt;\">지원대상</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 13pt;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">:</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 14pt;\">예비창업자 및 초기창업자</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">3.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 14pt;\">접수기간</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 13pt;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">:</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;2023. 4. 1.(토</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">∼&nbsp;<b>4</b></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><b>. 30.(일</b></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><b>) 24:00</b>&nbsp;까지</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">4.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 14pt;\">제출서류</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 13pt;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">:</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;[</span></span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 14pt;\">붙임</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">1]</span